nsition-opacity duration-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"neo-label text-[9px] border-2 border-neo-ink px-2 py-0.5\" style=\"background:var(--neo-accent)\">CRYPTO</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-bold opacity-50\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg>15 min<!-- --> · <!-- -->Nov 15, 2024</span></div><h3 class=\"font-black text-lg leading-snug tracking-tight mb-1 group-hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-2\">Zero-Knowledge Proofs: A Practical Introduction for Developers</h3><p class=\"text-sm font-bold opacity-60 leading-relaxed\">Implementing a basic zkSNARK circuit from scratch using Circom and snarkjs, with real-world use cases.</p></div><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"flex-shrink-0 self-center opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 -translate-x-2 group-hover:translate-x-0 transition-all duration-150\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#\" class=\"group flex items-start gap-5 border-2 border-neo-ink border-b-0 last:border-b-2 p-5 bg-neo-white hover:bg-neo-secondary transition-colors duration-100\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 font-black text-4xl leading-none text-neo-ink opacity-20 group-hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"neo-label text-[9px] border-2 border-neo-ink px-2 py-0.5\" style=\"background:var(--neo-secondary)\">SYSTEMS</span><span cl